; WHO 13 gateway: the DIMENSION request numbers a gateway answers itself (*#13**DIM##).
; Boundary probe of 2026-11-16 and 2026-11-17 on the 13 emulated gateways: DIMENSION 0..18,
; 20..26, 28..30, 39, 40, 41, 49, 50, 51, 52, 100, 255. DIMENSION 19 (uptime) changes between
; runs and is left out on purpose. DIMENSION 27 is left out as well: the repository suite
